<h2><a id="abstract" name="abstract">Abstract</a></h2>

<p>The XHTML Role Attribute defined in this specification provides XML languages with the ability integrate a "role" attribute into any markup language based upon [<a class="nref" href=
"#ref_XHTMLMOD">XHTMLMOD</a>].</p>

